      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is good however I'd propose you could adjust the idea to possibly have an instance creator set it to be impossible for quest users or android users to join, along with allowing the instance creator to only allow specific trust ranks to join. This change would allow PC users to not have to worry about their avatars being hidden or defaulting to fallbacks which would result in a more enjoyable experience for PCVR and Desktop users",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
